WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:05.647
Today’s task: plot (1, 3), (2, 5), (3, 7) and (4, 9).

2
00:00:05.647 --> 00:00:09.076
First set Quadrants to First quadrant. It starts empty.

3
00:00:09.076 --> 00:00:13.337
Tap the grid to plot a point. The table lists each one.

4
00:00:13.337 --> 00:00:15.166
Points of one color join into a line.

5
00:00:15.166 --> 00:00:17.167
A point in the wrong place? Drag it. It snaps to the grid.

6
00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:21.294
Pick another color to start a new line.

7
00:00:21.294 --> 00:00:24.453
Read the rule from the table: y is 2x + 1.

8
00:00:24.453 --> 00:00:32.991
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
